    "image": "Create a cinematic photorealistic 16:9 wide shot returning exactly to the composition of pipa-wake. Use that shot as the primary continuity reference, with LAIdy Pipa v2 and Maia Melodies v2 as mandatory identity references and the apartment-afterparty place for the set. Static eye-level view of the dark sofa centered in the ordinary apartment. Pipa remains on the left with one exhausted eye barely open, leaning against Maia. Maia remains asleep on the right. Keep the kitchenette, blinds, late-morning light, warm lamp, blankets, clothes, cups, takeaway boxes, balloons, confetti, tissues, glasses, generic bottles and lone high heel in the same believable positions. Preserve faces, hairstyles, proportions, outfits, screen positions and lighting. No new people, phone, nightclub, cleaned room, text, subtitles, logos, watermark or malformed anatomy.",
