    "animation": "One continuous static-camera two-and-a-half-second wide shot with no cut. @Element1 is LAIdy Pipa v2 on the left and @Element2 is Maia Melodies v2 on the right; @Image1 fixes the apartment, sofa and afterparty clutter. 0.0–0.6 s: Pipa gives sleeping Maia one brief unfocused look without lifting her head. 0.6–1.4 s: Pipa silently gives up, closes her eye and lets the tension leave her shoulders. Her head settles heavily back onto Maia, who does not wake. 1.4–2.5 s: both are again asleep and nearly motionless while the camera holds on the ruined-afterparty room. End on stable stillness for a hard cut to the Dom Kultury. Preserve identities, hair, clothing, sofa, props and screen direction. No dialogue, camera movement, zoom, broad gesture, smile, waking Maia, new people, morphing, extra limbs, subtitles, text or transition."
